ortant; border: 1px solid light-dark(rgb(196, 199, 197), rgb(65, 68, 66)); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Atualização&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; border: 1px solid light-dark(rgb(196, 199, 197), rgb(65, 68, 66)); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;O endereço da unidade &lt;b style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Ponta Verde&lt;/b&gt; está cadastrado como &quot;Av. A, 100&quot; nos pedidos 1 e 3, mas aparece como &quot;Av. A, 1000&quot; no pedido 5. Alterar o endereço exige modificar várias linhas, gerando risco de inconsistência.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; border: 1px solid light-dark(rgb(196, 199, 197), rgb(65, 68, 66)); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Inserção&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; border: 1px solid light-dark(rgb(196, 199, 197), rgb(65, 68, 66)); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Não é possível cadastrar uma nova &lt;b style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;unidade&lt;/b&gt; (ex: Farol) ou um novo &lt;b style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;produto&lt;/b&gt; (ex: Suco de Laranja) sem que um &lt;b style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;pedido&lt;/b&gt; seja realizado, pois não há registro na tabela sem um número de pedido.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; border: 1px solid light-dark(rgb(196, 199, 197), rgb(65, 68, 66)); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Exclusão&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; border: 1px solid light-dark(rgb(196, 199, 197), rgb(65, 68, 66)); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Ao excluir o &lt;b style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;pedido 2&lt;/b&gt;, perde-se o único registro existente da unidade &lt;b style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Pajuçara&lt;/b&gt; e do cliente com telefone &lt;b style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;99000-0002&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
